## Key Concepts

- Convolutive ICA with short-time framing
- Calibration-based whitening initialization
- Per-bin ICA vs. joint diagonalization trade-offs
- Cross-bin permutation alignment using known chirp timing
- Ground-truth evaluation plan excluding calibration data

